  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v6.0.10 - Aligned package version with the Benday.CosmosDb v6 core library so the two packages release together. Added LoginPageMessage option to CosmosIdentityOptions — an optional informational message rendered above the sign-in form on the UI package's login page (newlines preserved, HTML escaped). When null/empty (the default), nothing is rendered. Useful for displaying seeded test credentials in dev environments or scheduled-maintenance notices;\nv3.2.0 - Fixed some pretty massive bugs in the data access layer where partition keys were being ignored;\nv3.1.2 - No changes (version bump to match UI package).\nv3.1.1 - Fix CS0108 warnings: added 'new' keyword to GetAllAsync() in ICosmosDbClaimDefinitionStore and CosmosDbClaimDefinitionStore to explicitly hide inherited member.\nv3.1.0 - Added FirstName/LastName to CosmosIdentityUser. Added CosmosIdentityClaimDefinition model and ICosmosDbClaimDefinitionStore for claim type lookup tables. Registered claim definition store in DI.\nv3.0.0 - BREAKING: Target net10.0 only (drop netstandard2.1). Added passkey (WebAuthn/FIDO2) support via IUserPasskeyStore. Passkeys enabled by default with integrated login UX.\nv2.1.0 - Added ICosmosIdentityEmailSender interface, CosmosIdentityOptions (AllowRegistration, AdminRoleName, RequireConfirmedEmail), CosmosIdentitySeeder AdminRoleName support, and DI singleton registration for options\nv2.0.0 - BREAKING: Renamed all identity classes with Cosmos prefix to avoid namespace collisions (IdentityUser -> CosmosIdentityUser, IdentityRole -> CosmosIdentityRole, etc.)\nv1.1.0 - Update dependencies and package metadata; Changing target framework to netstandard2.1; Removing alpha tag\nv1.0.0 - Initial release with full ASP.NET Core Identity store implementations for Cosmos DB",
